# SOP Lang of the scenario "Edit session" (docs/js/scenarios.js, id story), one block per message.
# Generation model: Claude Opus 5.5 (claude-opus-5-5), 2026-11-04. Format and rules: ../CONVENTIONS.md.

## turn 1
# input: Draw a blue circle named A and a red square named B right of it.
@c1 command action=create shape=circle color=blue name=A
@c2 command action=create shape=square color=red name=B position=rightOf anchor=A

## turn 2
# input: Add a green triangle named C below A and connect A to it.
@c1 command action=create shape=triangle color=green name=C position=below anchor=A
@c2 command action=connect from=A to=C

## turn 3
# input: Connect B to C with a dashed line.
@c1 command action=connect from=B to=C style=dashed arrow=none

## turn 4
# input: Actually make A orange and give it a black border.
@c1 command action=set target=A color=orange outline=black

## turn 5
# input: Rename C to Leaf.
@c1 command action=rename target=C name=Leaf

## turn 6
# input: Swap A and B.
@c1 command action=swap target=A,B

## turn 7
# input: Undo.
@c1 command action=undo

## turn 8
# input: Duplicate B.
@c1 command action=duplicate target=B

## turn 9
# input: What is connected to Leaf?
@q1 question ask=neighbors target=Leaf

## turn 10
# input: Is A left of B?
@q1 question ask=check target=A position=leftOf anchor=B

## turn 11
# input: Add two small pink stars above A.
@c1 command action=create count=2 shape=star size=small color=pink position=above anchor=A

## turn 12
# input: Delete the pink stars.
#! scope: "the pink stars" is a description: every pink star of the canvas matches, also one drawn in another area
@m1 mention quantifier=all shape=star color=pink
@c1 command action=delete target=$m1

## turn 13
# input: Arrange everything in a grid.
@c1 command action=arrange layout=grid

## turn 14
# input: Describe the diagram.
#! scope: describes every shape of the canvas, not only this area
@q1 question ask=describe
